Hello:

I have a clearcase environment working on Solaris8 Sparc servers (2 VOB
Servers, 1 Views Server, 1 Home Directory Server and 4 Build Servers) with
NFS ad NIS configured and all work fine together. But whenever any user
mount any of the shared view to Linux Server and try to build a package, the
total environment is almost dead. Even the simple command react very slow on
both Linux and Solaris Servers, the ping shows 75% loss on these servers
etc.; Please help me resolving this problem.

Detail Specification:

Linux

nfsutils version-	0.3.3-5
Kernel version-  	2.4.18-3
OS Distribution- Redhat 7.3

Solaris

OS Distribution- Solaris 5.8


Thanks & Regards

Ravi Babu

